  "Abaucin 的选择性作用：从比较到证据链": "How the study explains abaucin’s selectivity",
  "依原文顺序读：受测菌株的药敏比较 → 动物模型 → 复合物结构 → 结合实验 → 脂蛋白转运。": "Susceptibility in clinical isolates → mouse outcomes → complex structures → binding → lipoprotein transport.",
  "对 6 株鲍曼不动杆菌临床分离株，abaucin 的最低抑菌浓度（MIC）为 1–16 μg/mL。对受测的其他耐药病原菌和三种肠道共生菌，MIC 均高于 128 μg/mL。": "Abaucin inhibited growth of all six clinical A. baumannii isolates at minimum inhibitory concentrations (MICs) of 1–16 μg/mL. MICs exceeded 128 μg/mL for the other resistant pathogens and the three gut commensals tested.",
  "正文报告了动物模型中的效应，为临床前证据增加了一层。组织、负担与生理结局是不同读数，不等于人体疗效。": "The mouse study adds preclinical evidence. Tissue injury, bacterial burden and respiratory function each measure a different aspect of the response.",
  "作者展示了两种结合状态。它们支持对形态和相对位置的描述，但状态差异并不能单独证明运动轨迹或某一步功能真的停止。": "Two drug-bound structures show the shapes and relative positions of the components. Functional measurements are needed to identify the affected transport step.",
  "作者用生物层干涉法测量药物与转运体的结合，再把结合测量与细胞层面的观察联系起来。": "The authors measure drug binding by biolayer interferometry and compare the binding results with observations in cells.",
  "作者把货物结合这一现象与后续交接区分开，用功能证据去核查结构所提示的解释。": "The assays distinguish cargo binding from onward handoff and test the explanation suggested by the structures.",
  "每行是一株鲍曼不动杆菌。右侧两列分别给出 abaucin 和氨苄西林对该株的最低抑菌浓度。": "Each row represents one isolate. The two columns on the right give its MICs for abaucin and ampicillin.",
  "对受测的产超广谱 β-内酰胺酶大肠杆菌和耐碳青霉烯肺炎克雷伯菌，abaucin 的 MIC 均高于 128 μg/mL。": "Abaucin MICs exceeded 128 μg/mL for the tested extended-spectrum β-lactamase-producing E. coli and carbapenem-resistant K. pneumoniae isolates.",
  "图 C 的三种拟杆菌都是肠道共生菌，abaucin 对它们的 MIC 均高于 128 μg/mL。": "Panel C shows three Bacteroides species found in the gut. Abaucin MICs exceeded 128 μg/mL for all three.",
  "代表图用于直观看形态，定量结论要去对应评分和样本数据核对。": "Compare tissue morphology in the images with the injury scores for individual samples.",
