  "先确认左、右各是什么状态，再比较轮廓和相对位置。它不展示两个状态的时间先后。": "Identify the states on the left and right, then compare their shapes and relative positions. The images do not establish their temporal order.",
  "此区域对应出版社这一版 PDF 的 3A；结构快照不提供时间先后。": "This region is panel 3A of the publisher’s PDF. The structural snapshots do not establish temporal order.",
